    "excerpt": "Johansen v. Johansen, 2021 UT App 130 (November 26, 2021). In this termination of alimony case, (Ex) Husband sought to terminate alimony because (Ex) Wife was allegedly cohabitating with Boyfriend. After Husband filed his case, Wife filed an answer denying cohabitation. Husband failed to disclose hi",
